From: Altera Fan Control Demo <altera@example.com>
Date: Mon, 26 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fan: add adi,axi-fan-control-1.00.a to compatibleFanTypes

Map the ADI AXI fan control IP compatible string to FanTypes::aspeed so
that the fansensor daemon probes and publishes hwmon data (fan1_input,
pwm1, temp1_input) from the adi,axi-fan-control-1.00.a platform device
on Agilex 5 BMC demo boards.

The ADI AXI fan controller (axi_fan_control.v from AnalogDevices HDL)
exposes standard hwmon sysfs attributes compatible with the aspeed layout
(fan1_input in RPM, pwm1 duty cycle 0-255) expected by dbus-sensors
fansensor.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 src/fan/FanMain.cpp | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/fan/FanMain.cpp b/src/fan/FanMain.cpp
index 0000001..0000002 100644
--- a/src/fan/FanMain.cpp
+++ b/src/fan/FanMain.cpp
@@ -84,7 +84,9 @@
     {"aspeed,ast2700-pwm-tach", FanTypes::aspeed},
     {"nuvoton,npcm750-pwm-fan", FanTypes::nuvoton},
     {"nuvoton,npcm845-pwm-fan", FanTypes::nuvoton},
-    {"hpe,gxp-fan-ctrl", FanTypes::hpe}
+    {"hpe,gxp-fan-ctrl", FanTypes::hpe},
+    // Altera Agilex 5 fan control (adi,axi-fan-control-1.00.a driver)
+    {"adi,axi-fan-control-1.00.a", FanTypes::aspeed}
     // add compatible string here for new fan type
 };
 
